<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<!--
  v03 数据瀑布 · slide-compare
  视觉语言：深底 + 金色脊柱 + 上下两块对比卡片，先 before 从屏顶坠落，金色光线横扫"转折提示"，再 after 坠落
  版式：顶部标签 + 金色渐变标题 + 上方 before 卡片（灰冷调）+ 中央金色横扫光线 + 下方 after 卡片（金色调）
  动画时间轴：
    t=0.0s   背景立即可见，顶部金光条 + 中央脊柱呼吸
    t=0.2s   GROWTH MOVE 顶部标签淡入
    t=0.5s   {{title}} 金色标题从底部上浮，金线下划
    t=1.5s   before 卡片从屏顶弹性坠入（带模糊→清晰、长拖尾）
    t=3.4s   中央金色光线扫过（左→右），暗示"放大"转折
    t=4.4s   after 卡片从屏顶弹性坠入（带模糊→清晰、长拖尾），下方右侧出现金色光晕
    t=6.0s   底部"微域生光"脚标渐显
    t=6.0–16s 全部元素定格，金色脊柱呼吸 idle
-->
<title>slide-compare · v03</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    width: 1080px;
    height: 1920px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #080808;
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', SimHei, sans-serif;
    color: #fff;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 1080px;
    height: 1920px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1100px at 50% 50%, rgba(201,162,39,0.10) 0%, transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 600px 400px at 50% 8%, rgba(232,196,107,0.20) 0%, transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #080808 60%, #050505 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 88px 76px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .top-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #d4af37 20%, #e8c46b 50%, #d4af37 80%, transparent 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px #c9a227, 0 0 48px rgba(201,162,39,0.4);
  }

  .spine {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 80px;
    width: 2px; height: 1760px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(212,175,55,0.0) 5%,
      rgba(212,175,55,0.28) 50%,
      rgba(212,175,55,0.0) 95%,
      transparent 100%);
    animation: spineBreath 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  @keyframes spineBreath {
    0%   { opacity: 0.3; }
    100% { opacity: 0.75; }
  }

  .grid-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(212,175,55,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(212,175,55,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 120px 120px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1300px at 50% 50%, #000 30%, transparent 80%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1300px at 50% 50%, #000 30%, transparent 80%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* 顶部 section 标签 */
  .section-tag {
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(232,196,107,0.6);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease 0.2s forwards;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* 标题 */
  .slide-title {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4d97a 0%, #e8c46b 40%, #c9a227 70%, #9b7b1f 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(232,196,107,0.2);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px);
    animation: slideUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 0.5s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes slideUp {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* 金线分隔 */
  .divider {
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #f0d060, #c9a227, rgba(201,162,39,0.12));
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    border-radius: 1px;
    margin: 30px 0 40px;
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    animation:
      lineGrow 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 0.9s forwards,
      shimmer 3s linear 1.6s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes lineGrow {
    0%   { transform: scaleX(0); }
    100% { transform: scaleX(1); }
  }
  @keyframes shimmer {
    from { background-position: 200% 0; }
    to   { background-position: -200% 0; }
  }

  /* 对比容器 */
  .compare-wrapper {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* before 卡片：从屏顶坠落 */
  .compare-card-before {
    flex: 1;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px 48px;
    position: relative;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-900px);
    filter: blur(8px);
    animation: cardDrop 1.1s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.4, 1) 1.5s forwards;
    will-change: transform, opacity, filter;
  }
  @keyframes cardDrop {
    0%   { transform: translateY(-900px); opacity: 0; filter: blur(8px); }
    70%  { filter: blur(0); }
    100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; filter: blur(0); }
  }

  /* before 卡片左侧灰白竖线 */
  .compare-card-before::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 20px; bottom: 20px;
    width: 4px;
    border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), rgba(255,255,255,0.15));
  }

  /* 中间转折分隔区 + 金色横扫光线 */
  .compare-divider-zone {
    height: 88px;
    margin: 18px 0;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sweep-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: -100%;
    width: 100%;
    height: 4px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(232,196,107,0.0) 10%, #f4d97a 50%, rgba(232,196,107,0.0) 90%, transparent 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 32px #c9a227, 0 0 64px rgba(232,196,107,0.5);
    animation: sweep 1.0s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 3.4s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes sweep {
    0%   { left: -100%; opacity: 0; }
    20%  { opacity: 1; }
    80%  { opacity: 1; }
    100% { left: 100%; opacity: 0; }
  }
  .arrow-icon {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    font-size: 44px;
    color: #e8c46b;
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(232,196,107,0.6);
    opacity: 0;
    animation:
      fadeIn 0.5s ease 4.0s forwards,
      arrowBounce 1.8s ease-in-out 5.0s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes arrowBounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50%       { transform: translateY(8px); }
  }

  /* after 卡片：从屏顶坠落（在 sweep 之后） */
  .compare-card-after {
    flex: 1;
    background: rgba(201,162,39,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.45);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px 48px 40px 56px;
    position: relative;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-900px);
    filter: blur(8px);
    animation: cardDrop 1.1s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.4, 1) 4.4s forwards;
    will-change: transform, opacity, filter;
    box-shadow: 0 0 48px rgba(201,162,39,0.12);
  }
  /* after 卡片左侧金竖线 */
  .compare-card-after::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 20px; bottom: 20px;
    width: 4px;
    border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0d060, #c9a227, rgba(201,162,39,0.3));
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(232,196,107,0.5);
  }

  /* 卡片标签 */
  .card-label {
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .card-label-before { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
  .card-label-after  {
    color: #e8c46b;
    text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(232,196,107,0.4);
  }

  /* 卡片正文 */
  .card-text {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .card-text-before { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); }
  .card-text-after  { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.96); }

  /* 底部品牌 */
  .brand-footer {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease 6.0s forwards;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .brand-w {
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 46px; font-weight: 700;
    color: #c9a227; line-height: 1;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(201,162,39,0.45);
  }
  .brand-name {
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', SimHei, sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 10px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  .bottom-glow {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #c9a227 30%, #c9a227 70%, transparent 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.7s ease 6.0s forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    100% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  .duration-debug {
    position: absolute; bottom: 14px; right: 22px; z-index: 99;
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stage">
  <div class="top-glow"></div>
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="spine"></div>

  <div class="section-tag">成长动作 · GROWTH MOVE</div>
  <div class="slide-title">{{title}}</div>
  <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="compare-wrapper">
    <div class="compare-card-before">
      <div class="card-label card-label-before">做对的事 · RIGHT MOVE</div>
      <div class="card-text card-text-before">{{compare_before}}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-divider-zone" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="sweep-line"></div>
      <span class="arrow-icon">&#11015;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-card-after">
      <div class="card-label card-label-after">把它放大 · SCALE UP</div>
      <div class="card-text card-text-after">{{compare_after}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="brand-footer">
    <span class="brand-w">W</span>
    <span class="brand-name">微域生光</span>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-glow"></div>
  <div class="duration-debug">{{DURATION_MS}}ms · slide-{{index}} · {{slide_type}}</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
